WEBVTT

01:40.990 --> 01:45.710
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.250 --> 01:50.740
[Episode 19]

01:52.039 --> 01:54.479
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

01:52.350 --> 01:54.590
Alright, let's have a fire duel then.

01:56.229 --> 01:57.960
Master, please be our witness.

02:16.340 --> 02:17.270
Junior Huaizhu,

02:17.910 --> 02:20.040
you have mastered the Pure Yang Flame?

02:21.960 --> 02:23.030
Master!

02:23.910 --> 02:26.400
Now that Junior Huaizhu
has got the hang of the Pure Yang Flame,

02:26.400 --> 02:27.600
the Divine Fire Villa

02:27.910 --> 02:30.780
no longer needs to
yield to the Wangquan Sword!

02:30.870 --> 02:32.590
Stop talking nonsense.

02:38.690 --> 02:39.840
Renfeng,

02:41.400 --> 02:42.960
considering you haven't

02:42.960 --> 02:45.079
actually killed those demons,

02:45.880 --> 02:48.350
I order you to send
the demons in the cellar

02:48.380 --> 02:50.660
back to their own clans personally.

02:50.970 --> 02:53.760
After that, take some time to introspect.

02:54.600 --> 02:56.480
Don't cause any more trouble.

02:59.000 --> 02:59.900
Yes, Master.

03:00.360 --> 03:03.280
Disciples of the Divine Fire Villa,
heed my instruction.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.150
Yes, Master.

03:04.710 --> 03:06.770
Always have compassion in your heart

03:06.840 --> 03:08.750
and help people in need.

03:09.380 --> 03:11.110
Never meddle in mortal affairs

03:12.160 --> 03:14.090
and be a good man.

03:15.030 --> 03:15.950
Yes, Master!

03:36.400 --> 03:38.829
Thinking about your Miss Huaizhu again?

03:46.590 --> 03:49.440
I heard she scolded you today.

03:50.690 --> 03:52.850
I thought you'd be pissed off.

03:56.670 --> 03:58.620
That's because you didn't see

03:59.920 --> 04:02.400
the beauty and power
of that Pure Yang Flame.

04:05.550 --> 04:06.700
This fire

04:08.150 --> 04:09.150
matches her well.

04:18.070 --> 04:18.800
Xiaotan,

04:19.350 --> 04:21.740
you use your unique secret technique
to absorb demonic energy

04:21.740 --> 04:23.870
and help me cultivate the Divine Fire.

04:23.870 --> 04:25.200
Although it works a bit,

04:25.320 --> 04:26.920
I feel it's still not enough.

04:28.000 --> 04:29.430
Is there a better way?

04:32.280 --> 04:33.909
There is,

04:34.720 --> 04:36.620
but it's not time to tell you yet.

04:36.650 --> 04:37.440
What?

04:38.090 --> 04:39.150
You don't trust me?

04:39.800 --> 04:41.070
Should I trust you?

04:41.750 --> 04:44.870
You're still hung up on Dongfang Huaizhu.

04:48.430 --> 04:49.490
Having you with me,

04:51.000 --> 04:53.159
I've already lost interest in her.

04:55.040 --> 04:55.950
Is that so?

04:56.860 --> 04:59.510
But there's been a rumor among us demons,

05:00.270 --> 05:02.470
saying that female Dongfangs

05:02.680 --> 05:06.080
are the real foundation
of the Spiritual Blood inheritance.

05:09.390 --> 05:11.800
That's nonsense. Don't believe it.

05:16.250 --> 05:17.850
I don't care what you think.

05:18.510 --> 05:20.620
Anyway, I belong to you now.

05:20.830 --> 05:24.030
We demons of the Leech Clan
are all stubborn.

05:26.070 --> 05:27.910
You must not fail me.

05:30.390 --> 05:31.430
Xiaotan,

05:31.520 --> 05:33.610
you're the last one I'd ever fail.

05:34.010 --> 05:35.370
You are my treasure.

05:47.250 --> 05:48.570
What is this?

05:49.470 --> 05:52.010
It's completely burnt.
Why are you keeping this?

05:52.010 --> 05:53.650
It might come in handy one day.

05:53.650 --> 05:54.380
Don't mind it.

05:54.380 --> 05:55.909
It's none of your business.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.980
Aren't you afraid of people finding out?

06:09.320 --> 06:12.240
This is my private residence.
I'm the boss here.

06:32.500 --> 06:34.450
You were a vessel

06:34.470 --> 06:36.990
your mother prepared for Jia Lan.

06:37.560 --> 06:40.430
Everything your mother, Jiang Juanxue, did

06:40.520 --> 06:43.810
was to find a new body for Jia Lan.

06:43.880 --> 06:45.310
That turns out

06:46.040 --> 06:47.510
to be Dongfang Huaizhu.

06:55.540 --> 06:59.780
So that's Jiang Juanxue's daughter?

07:01.410 --> 07:04.340
Very good. I like this vessel.

07:45.440 --> 07:47.080
What on earth is this?

08:05.570 --> 08:06.850
Who are you?

08:07.720 --> 08:09.720
Why do you have my magical artifact?

08:11.230 --> 08:12.280
I know who you are.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.900
The celestial demon, Jiuhuo.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.510
I also know that

08:16.640 --> 08:18.450
you're from 20 years later.

08:18.530 --> 08:19.950
You can't come over now.

08:20.160 --> 08:22.900
As long as you use my way

08:23.070 --> 08:24.730
to fix the golden lotus for me,

08:24.830 --> 08:26.430
I will be able to return.

08:27.590 --> 08:28.620
Ridiculous.

08:29.670 --> 08:31.000
Why would I even do that?

08:32.030 --> 08:33.690
Be my underling

08:33.750 --> 08:35.630
and help me accomplish my grand plan.

08:35.630 --> 08:37.890
I'll surely grant you the highest merit.

08:39.000 --> 08:42.120
Who does he think he can fool
with mere sweet talk?

08:42.970 --> 08:44.169
Smart one,

08:44.870 --> 08:47.130
you have plenty of time to think about it.

08:47.510 --> 08:48.770
Just think it through.

09:29.870 --> 09:31.510
It's been almost five months.

09:31.510 --> 09:33.130
You still don't look pregnant.

09:33.130 --> 09:34.660
Aren't you a bit too skinny?

09:35.750 --> 09:37.120
I'm eating well.

09:38.840 --> 09:41.700
It's just that I've been
craving spicy food lately.

09:42.440 --> 09:44.170
Sour for a boy, spicy for a girl.

09:44.630 --> 09:47.160
You're probably going to have
a little niece.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.390
Actually,

09:52.670 --> 09:55.600
a little nephew would be nice too.

09:57.720 --> 09:58.780
What should I do?

09:59.750 --> 10:02.320
I've only been thinking of girl names.

10:16.870 --> 10:17.790
Yan,

10:19.790 --> 10:22.720
I promise I'll keep you and your child
safe and sound.

10:34.630 --> 10:35.550
Hongye,

10:35.870 --> 10:38.800
are you still sad about
not taking good care of Mu Mie?

10:39.360 --> 10:40.620
Given that situation,

10:41.710 --> 10:43.440
it's not your fault, actually.

10:46.750 --> 10:49.670
Regretting and grieving
can't make up for anything.

10:49.670 --> 10:51.800
We will definitely change all of this.

10:53.360 --> 10:55.820
Yitan, let's go to the Sky-breaking Temple.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.960
Dad, Dad.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.510
Dad.

11:07.510 --> 11:08.670
Here, take this.

11:08.750 --> 11:09.630
Thank you, sir.

11:18.980 --> 11:19.990
Let me do it.

11:21.590 --> 11:22.470
Take it slow.

11:24.830 --> 11:26.400
Here, this is for you.

11:27.960 --> 11:29.000
Thank you.

11:29.870 --> 11:31.150
Thank you.

11:52.530 --> 11:54.130
The Black Fox has descended.

11:54.590 --> 11:56.390
The eternal night has befallen.

11:56.930 --> 11:58.220
This Sky City

11:59.140 --> 12:01.070
has been turned into a living hell.

12:02.560 --> 12:06.440
Wonder how much longer
we can keep protecting them.

12:07.780 --> 12:09.570
As long as we can.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.120
No matter what,

12:16.890 --> 12:18.220
thank you for saving me.

12:22.880 --> 12:23.730
This...

12:25.270 --> 12:26.600
I'm returning it to you.

12:31.850 --> 12:33.180
When she was still here,

12:33.690 --> 12:36.890
she kept nourishing this wreath
with her demonic energy,

12:37.270 --> 12:40.600
treating it as the most precious treasure
in the world.

12:48.870 --> 12:49.750
Dummy!

12:52.320 --> 12:53.550
Next time,

12:53.660 --> 12:56.120
could you give me gifts
that are easy to keep?

13:03.150 --> 13:06.120
Look at you, still so tongue-tied as ever.

13:06.240 --> 13:08.450
I'll like anything you give me.

13:14.560 --> 13:16.120
Don't cry, Dummy.

13:16.760 --> 13:18.530
My life might be

13:18.870 --> 13:20.240
like a flash in the pan.

13:21.540 --> 13:22.610
But having met you,

13:24.200 --> 13:25.260
bickered with you,

13:27.000 --> 13:28.530
and fallen in love with you,

13:30.240 --> 13:31.760
I have no regrets at all.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.970
The vigor of this flower wreath

13:49.370 --> 13:51.430
was preserved by her demonic energy.

13:52.410 --> 13:53.600
Since she's gone,

13:56.510 --> 13:58.150
all of this will be gone too.

14:06.690 --> 14:07.790
Miss Cuiyu,

14:09.390 --> 14:12.540
you are so kind and gentle.

14:13.000 --> 14:13.200
And...

14:13.200 --> 14:13.960
Mr. Mu,

14:15.040 --> 14:16.900
after we get through this ordeal,

14:17.600 --> 14:18.440
let's

14:20.600 --> 14:21.760
part ways.

15:02.440 --> 15:05.170
It's been a while
since our last formal assembly.

15:10.630 --> 15:13.900
Let's bet on who'll be the last
to arrive today.

15:14.350 --> 15:16.700
No need to bet. It's definitely Qingmu.

15:16.790 --> 15:18.910
She always sleeps in
for her beauty rest until noon.

15:18.910 --> 15:21.340
From now on, we'll offer no discounts
on all the gems your Li family uses

15:21.340 --> 15:22.600
for magical artifacts

15:22.600 --> 15:23.630
Qingmu, welcome!

15:23.670 --> 15:24.200
Hi, Zui.

15:25.910 --> 15:27.530
it's been such a long and hurried journey.

15:27.530 --> 15:28.560
I'm exhausted.

15:28.590 --> 15:29.450
Take a rest now.

15:31.280 --> 15:32.030
Hongye.

15:32.790 --> 15:34.510
Even Qingmu has arrived.

15:34.920 --> 15:37.090
Where are Zizai and Qiyue?

15:37.270 --> 15:37.910
Yeah!

15:38.790 --> 15:40.440
My brother's always punctual.

15:40.440 --> 15:41.750
Hongye ordered me and Qiyue

15:41.750 --> 15:43.270
to gather evidence from several places.

15:43.270 --> 15:45.060
That's why we're late. Sorry.

15:44.790 --> 15:47.890
[Deng Qiyue from Mask Group]

15:46.440 --> 15:47.270
Qiyue,

15:47.870 --> 15:51.590
you've finished investigating
the Western Regions and come back?

15:51.590 --> 15:52.970
The so-called "Immovable Mountain"

15:52.970 --> 15:54.680
actually moves pretty fast!

15:55.080 --> 15:56.530
I was right near it.

15:57.040 --> 15:58.780
OK, let's get down to the business.

15:58.780 --> 16:00.710
Qiyue, you go first.

16:01.310 --> 16:03.390
The information I got in the Western Regions

16:03.390 --> 16:05.610
is pretty much the same as what you all know.

16:05.610 --> 16:08.110
From Nanchui to Tianmen Pass,

16:06.400 --> 16:10.440
[Nanchui] [Western Regions]

16:08.230 --> 16:09.900
a huge chasm has been formed.

16:10.320 --> 16:11.290
And these chasms

16:11.400 --> 16:13.050
have created a humongous barrier,

16:13.050 --> 16:15.460
[Nanchui]

16:13.670 --> 16:15.360
allowing no demons in or out.

16:16.460 --> 16:17.460
It's the Boundary

16:17.700 --> 16:19.230
drawn by the Third Young Master

16:19.230 --> 16:21.130
of the Aolai Kingdom to keep
the Black Fox out.

16:21.130 --> 16:22.710
So what exactly did you see

16:23.030 --> 16:24.830
in the future, 20 years from now?

16:26.340 --> 16:28.340
The Golden Dawn will break the Boundary.

16:28.340 --> 16:29.600
Black Fox will show up.

16:30.400 --> 16:32.130
And eternal night will befall.

16:34.240 --> 16:34.840
Hongye,

16:35.660 --> 16:36.720
20 years later,

16:37.080 --> 16:38.610
will our Mask Group members

16:39.190 --> 16:40.920
really all be wiped out?

16:42.310 --> 16:43.950
Zizai, me!

16:44.670 --> 16:45.870
I will still be alive.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.680
Having returned from the future 20 years later,

16:57.680 --> 16:59.340
we can surely change all this.

16:59.750 --> 17:02.450
Can the future really be changed?

17:03.040 --> 17:03.900
Yes, of course!

17:04.000 --> 17:05.750
Isn't it why we established the Mask Group?

17:05.750 --> 17:07.700
To break all the rules,

17:07.829 --> 17:10.030
to challenge all impossibilities, huh?

17:10.030 --> 17:11.720
Even if this Black Fox's threat
looms large,

17:11.720 --> 17:12.680
I'm not afraid.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.890
We will surely emerge victorious.

17:14.920 --> 17:15.720
That's right.

17:16.160 --> 17:18.160
The future hasn't arrived yet.

17:18.750 --> 17:20.880
So we still stand a chance to change it.

17:21.359 --> 17:24.230
Everything in the world is ever-changing.

17:24.550 --> 17:26.619
We need to take
the first step towards change

17:26.619 --> 17:28.880
and strike with the sword
to cut through the dark.

17:28.880 --> 17:31.000
So we can't recklessly
step out of the Boundary.

17:31.000 --> 17:32.730
We must get to know the Black Fox

17:32.760 --> 17:34.350
and find a way to defeat it.

17:34.590 --> 17:35.960
Isn't it just a fox demon?

17:35.960 --> 17:37.240
Let's split up to investigate!

17:37.240 --> 17:38.350
We can surely find its weakness.

17:38.350 --> 17:39.110
Exactly.

17:39.200 --> 17:40.710
But the point is that

17:40.790 --> 17:43.110
we've looked through
all the information about the Black Fox

17:43.110 --> 17:44.420
in the Yiqi Alliance.

17:44.570 --> 17:45.550
This is all we have.

17:45.550 --> 17:47.440
We'll go investigate
the Black Fox's birthplace,

17:47.440 --> 17:48.520
the Beast Kingdom.

17:49.070 --> 17:50.460
The Beast Kingdom?

17:51.070 --> 17:53.260
Jiuhuo was sealed in the Beast Kingdom.

17:53.260 --> 17:56.260
Jia Lan also transformed
into the Black Fox in the Beast Kingdom.

17:56.260 --> 17:58.920
Why did the Beast Kingdom
have the nerve to do this 500 years ago?

17:58.920 --> 18:01.580
What on earth happened in that dungeon?

18:01.670 --> 18:02.830
We'll delve into them all.

18:02.830 --> 18:04.370
I'll dispatch someone
to the Beast Kingdom now.

18:04.370 --> 18:05.850
No, I'll go in person.

18:07.050 --> 18:08.310
Quzhuo, you go with me.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.550
The rest of you stay in the Yiqi Alliance,

18:10.550 --> 18:12.280
ready to support us at any time.

18:13.540 --> 18:14.680
Give me three days.

18:15.020 --> 18:15.830
I'll get things ready

18:15.830 --> 18:17.500
for your travel in the Beast Kingdom.

18:17.500 --> 18:18.110
Okay.

18:21.440 --> 18:23.580
He takes me only!

18:25.510 --> 18:26.750
Great!

18:29.960 --> 18:30.920
Hongye's got a sharp eye.

18:30.920 --> 18:31.510
Hongye.

18:37.000 --> 18:38.460
The hairpin you asked for.

18:39.370 --> 18:41.700
This is the first time my Ruyi Pavilion has

18:41.790 --> 18:43.920
made the same design twice.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.170
Good thing Young Master Wangquan

18:47.170 --> 18:48.380
is rich and generous.

18:48.750 --> 18:49.430
Thanks.

19:06.490 --> 19:07.950
This scented tea is great.

19:08.460 --> 19:11.160
Of course, this is my careful pick.

19:15.030 --> 19:16.000
Miss Dongfang,

19:17.530 --> 19:19.350
we've got some clues about the matter

19:19.350 --> 19:21.010
you entrusted me to look into.

19:28.410 --> 19:31.670
Before marrying your father,
your mother, Jiang Juanxue,

19:32.050 --> 19:34.580
used to be the Northern Hill Sect's Saintess.

19:35.350 --> 19:36.680
The Northern Hill Sect?

19:39.110 --> 19:40.390
There's someone

19:41.060 --> 19:43.350
who should know more about this than I do.

19:49.800 --> 19:50.480
My father.

19:51.480 --> 19:54.740
Back then, to marry Jiang Juanxue,
Master Dongfang gave up

19:55.040 --> 19:57.000
his promising career and stepped away

19:57.000 --> 19:58.600
from the martial arts world.

19:59.690 --> 20:03.130
[Pharmaceutical Yard]

20:13.030 --> 20:13.680
Father.

20:14.990 --> 20:15.730
Huaizhu.

20:16.300 --> 20:16.950
Come on,

20:17.720 --> 20:18.720
sit by my side.

20:21.960 --> 20:23.410
It's midsummer.

20:25.400 --> 20:28.550
There are plenty of stars every night.

20:31.440 --> 20:32.750
In the past,

20:33.590 --> 20:35.190
your mother liked to sit here

20:35.350 --> 20:38.680
and gaze at the stars
whenever something was bothering her.

20:39.350 --> 20:41.110
She preferred to keep

20:41.750 --> 20:43.350
all the pressure to herself.

20:44.550 --> 20:45.790
My dear Huaizhu,

20:48.350 --> 20:49.810
you're actually the same.

20:54.070 --> 20:54.790
Father.

20:56.790 --> 21:00.590
You seem to have had something
on your mind since your return.

21:01.830 --> 21:05.920
And it's related to your mother.

21:11.550 --> 21:13.310
Do you have anything to ask me?

21:18.030 --> 21:18.640
Father.

21:20.400 --> 21:22.260
Do you know Mother's background?

21:22.680 --> 21:27.720
She came from the Northern Hill Sect
of the Beast Kingdom.

21:30.790 --> 21:32.270
Then why did she come here?

21:33.940 --> 21:35.440
To meet me.

21:36.990 --> 21:38.350
Your mother once said

21:38.690 --> 21:41.640
she used up all the luck in her life

21:42.000 --> 21:43.440
just to meet me.

21:49.160 --> 21:52.760
I remember,
shortly after giving birth to Qinlan,

21:53.200 --> 21:54.730
she was hanging by a thread.

21:57.480 --> 22:00.290
It was summer too.

22:01.720 --> 22:03.520
The stars were just as numerous.

22:05.310 --> 22:07.920
I still remember she told me

22:09.000 --> 22:10.240
to forgive her

22:11.360 --> 22:14.230
for not telling me all her secrets,

22:15.720 --> 22:19.400
for bearing and doing so much on her own.

22:21.830 --> 22:23.310
Why didn't she tell you

22:24.610 --> 22:26.470
and face it together with you?

22:28.500 --> 22:29.470
She said

22:30.550 --> 22:33.720
the story behind her was very dark.

22:34.860 --> 22:36.600
She wanted to keep

22:36.830 --> 22:40.450
that Dongfang Churi she knew,
who could light up everyone's world,

22:40.450 --> 22:41.530
for you all.

22:45.020 --> 22:47.780
I can give you your mother's letter now.

22:50.950 --> 22:51.750
Letter?

22:54.510 --> 22:58.110
Your mother wrote you this letter.

23:01.550 --> 23:02.510
She said

23:03.750 --> 23:05.350
she felt guilty towards you.

23:05.890 --> 23:09.440
If one day you want an answer,

23:11.560 --> 23:12.920
you could open this letter.

23:12.870 --> 23:21.230
[To Huaizhu]

23:27.200 --> 23:28.270
Father, you've

23:29.300 --> 23:31.100
never opened it all these years?

23:32.000 --> 23:34.130
This letter is from your mother to you.

23:34.560 --> 23:35.950
Why would I read it?

23:48.800 --> 23:49.690
Huaizhu,

23:50.330 --> 23:52.780
I have lived a life of twists and turns.

23:53.440 --> 23:55.450
Only after I met your father

23:55.680 --> 23:57.880
did I start to live like a normal person.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.920
But as a mother,

24:00.400 --> 24:02.810
I have always felt guilty towards you.

24:03.750 --> 24:06.320
If you have the courage
to change your fate,

24:06.770 --> 24:09.000
go to the Drunken Dream Tower
in the Beast Kingdom,

24:09.000 --> 24:11.090
find a person named Er Zhuyu,

24:11.200 --> 24:13.600
and manage to get
the Twilight Mist Flower.

24:14.310 --> 24:18.250
Then you will get
all the answers you're looking for.

24:20.640 --> 24:24.810
From Jiang Juanxue,
Northern Hill Sect's Saintess.

24:25.570 --> 24:28.870
This is your mother's true identity.

24:34.090 --> 24:37.440
[From Jiang Juanxue,
Northern Hill Sect's Saintess.]

24:36.360 --> 24:37.060
Father,

24:38.340 --> 24:40.070
I need to go to the Beast Kingdom

24:40.200 --> 24:41.830
to investigate the whole story.

24:41.830 --> 24:42.360
Go ahead.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.030
Remember,

24:49.810 --> 24:53.270
don't be afraid of the answers
to some questions.

24:55.110 --> 24:56.920
I want more than just an answer.

24:57.320 --> 24:58.780
I also need to work out a way

24:59.570 --> 25:02.900
to change everything
that's going to happen 20 years later.

25:04.820 --> 25:08.060
As expected of my daughter.

25:16.040 --> 25:17.450
The Drunken Dream Tower.

25:19.000 --> 25:20.470
The Twilight Mist Flower.

25:24.790 --> 25:25.720
Junior Huaizhu,

25:26.830 --> 25:29.400
you sure have a lot of secrets.

26:13.570 --> 26:16.220
You're drinking without saying a word.

26:23.850 --> 26:26.160
Then, as usual, I'll take a guess first.

26:29.500 --> 26:30.470
A man.

26:39.000 --> 26:40.130
From the Mask Group.

26:51.880 --> 26:52.810
With three eyes.

27:00.960 --> 27:02.240
You already knew the answer,

27:02.240 --> 27:04.000
yet you still made me drink three cups!

27:04.000 --> 27:04.720
With your tolerance,

27:04.720 --> 27:06.850
even 30 cups are a piece of cake for you.

27:07.680 --> 27:10.640
So? Did he hurt your feelings?

27:12.980 --> 27:13.790
No.

27:15.330 --> 27:16.750
I just feel like

27:17.440 --> 27:19.210
there's a rock pressing

27:19.350 --> 27:21.110
on my heart, weighing me down

27:21.200 --> 27:22.310
all day long.

27:23.790 --> 27:25.320
Have you ever felt the same?

27:26.110 --> 27:26.710
Of course.

27:27.110 --> 27:28.910
Because of your crush, Huaizhu?

27:33.830 --> 27:34.510
However,

27:35.810 --> 27:37.250
when I hear her voice,

27:37.870 --> 27:38.890
see her smiles,

27:39.290 --> 27:40.600
and stay with her,

27:40.920 --> 27:42.120
the rock disappears.

27:43.280 --> 27:45.250
Yet once we're apart,

27:45.590 --> 27:48.680
the rock is back again.

27:48.810 --> 27:51.370
Right? I feel the same way.

27:51.920 --> 27:53.780
Worried about losing him though,

27:54.110 --> 27:58.240
I still look forward to seeing him every day.

27:58.480 --> 27:59.240
Zui,

28:00.860 --> 28:03.690
then you should learn from me.

28:05.590 --> 28:06.620
Learn what?

28:06.970 --> 28:08.050
To seek answers,

28:08.600 --> 28:09.730
not to wait for them.

28:10.830 --> 28:11.590
But how?

28:12.490 --> 28:15.280
Let's think of a way together.

28:37.060 --> 28:37.860
Hongye.

28:37.800 --> 28:41.650
[Unparalleled Sword]

28:38.480 --> 28:40.410
The Beast Kingdom is treacherous.

28:40.720 --> 28:43.400
Are you sure you'll only
let Quzhuo go with you?

28:44.570 --> 28:45.900
Making a fuss can easily

28:46.350 --> 28:47.750
leak things out and cause

28:47.750 --> 28:49.010
unnecessary trouble.

28:49.920 --> 28:51.030
While I'm away,

28:51.490 --> 28:53.290
you're in charge of all affairs.

28:54.300 --> 28:55.100
Also,

28:58.350 --> 28:59.750
spend more time with Zui,

28:59.890 --> 29:02.720
trying to figure out her thoughts.

29:04.920 --> 29:05.270
Hongye...

29:05.270 --> 29:05.830
Yitan,

29:07.240 --> 29:08.920
you see the big picture and think a lot,

29:08.920 --> 29:11.380
hoping to do things perfectly.
That's good.

29:12.260 --> 29:14.920
But when it comes
to a relationship, hesitation

29:14.960 --> 29:16.060
means cowardice.

29:42.430 --> 29:43.590
[Talismans of the Great Grotto]

29:45.810 --> 29:48.180
Hongye and Yitan should
be done talking by now, right?

29:48.180 --> 29:49.390
So next,

29:50.500 --> 29:52.430
let's get down to business as well.

29:54.710 --> 29:57.240
What "business"
could you two possibly have?

29:57.690 --> 29:59.040
This is a truth-telling talisman.

29:59.040 --> 30:00.830
Being enchanted by it,
one must speak the truth.

30:00.830 --> 30:01.850
The side effect is

30:01.900 --> 30:03.200
vomiting the next day.

30:03.740 --> 30:05.270
The wine is the Green Bamboo Leaf.

30:05.270 --> 30:07.290
It can force one
to speak the truth as well.

30:07.290 --> 30:09.440
The side effect is also
vomiting the next day.

30:09.440 --> 30:10.900
-Choose one.
-Choose one.

30:11.360 --> 30:11.940
I...

30:11.970 --> 30:13.710
Yang Yitan must have feelings for you.

30:13.710 --> 30:15.320
Even a blind man could tell.

30:19.870 --> 30:21.570
I think it makes sense.

30:21.720 --> 30:23.070
Now, some worries just stop Yitan

30:23.070 --> 30:24.070
from confessing.

30:24.070 --> 30:25.670
We need to force it out of him.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.880
There are plenty of ways!

30:26.880 --> 30:28.340
-Choose one.
-Choose one.

30:28.550 --> 30:30.260
I will choose,

30:30.350 --> 30:31.030
but...

30:32.640 --> 30:35.240
Is there one
without the vomiting side effect?

30:35.310 --> 30:37.780
Yitan was deeply wounded in Sky City.

30:37.810 --> 30:39.310
It's a matter of lifelong importance.

30:39.310 --> 30:40.830
A little vomiting is totally fine!

30:40.830 --> 30:42.560
Zizai, he'll vomit either way.

30:42.980 --> 30:43.910
Why not use both?

30:48.640 --> 30:49.640
Come on.

30:50.840 --> 30:52.900
You can really hold your liquor.

31:16.030 --> 31:18.420
Yitan, you may not know.

31:18.440 --> 31:21.170
I'm overwhelmed by anxiety.

31:21.430 --> 31:22.960
This line has been repeated

31:23.070 --> 31:24.400
countless times today.

31:26.400 --> 31:27.960
Whenever I imagine myself

31:28.040 --> 31:31.450
being all alone 20 years later,

31:33.490 --> 31:34.530
I just...

31:35.880 --> 31:36.640
I just

31:38.620 --> 31:40.970
want you to have another drink, Yitan.

31:41.070 --> 31:42.790
No more wine. Or I'll get drunk.

31:42.790 --> 31:44.830
Have one more, Yitan, just one more.

31:44.830 --> 31:45.960
Yeah, just drink it.

31:46.400 --> 31:47.710
I'm suffering inside!

31:47.920 --> 31:49.240
Come on, bottoms up.

32:03.480 --> 32:05.960
I think I drank

32:06.880 --> 32:09.510
the special one.

32:15.160 --> 32:15.830
He...

32:16.200 --> 32:16.940
What did he say?

32:16.940 --> 32:18.920
He said the moon is so full tonight.

32:19.030 --> 32:19.660
Really?

32:19.750 --> 32:20.200
Yes.

32:22.790 --> 32:23.450
Yang Yitan.

32:25.070 --> 32:26.400
Answer me right now.

32:26.400 --> 32:28.100
Do you like Zui or not?

32:28.430 --> 32:30.350
You're such a heavyweight!

32:30.720 --> 32:32.850
Are you going to knock me out with wine?

32:35.140 --> 32:36.880
Whether I like Zui or not

32:37.000 --> 32:39.350
has nothing to do with you, blotto man!

32:41.510 --> 32:42.590
But now you look

32:43.400 --> 32:45.260
quite similar to Zui when I first

32:46.000 --> 32:46.750
met her.

32:47.830 --> 32:49.590
The first time you met Zui?

32:52.160 --> 32:53.000
I see.

32:53.920 --> 32:55.000
Back then,

32:55.000 --> 32:57.400
Zui must be very young, right?

33:00.160 --> 33:01.270
That day,

33:02.060 --> 33:04.070
it happened to be her family's banquet.

33:04.070 --> 33:04.870
She was seven,

33:06.510 --> 33:08.710
but she sneakily drank their rice wine.

33:09.350 --> 33:10.930
Then she heard that

33:11.070 --> 33:14.160
I was her betrothed husband.

33:15.000 --> 33:16.110
She totally lost it

33:17.200 --> 33:18.070
and ran after me,

33:18.070 --> 33:20.070
cursing and biting.

33:22.830 --> 33:24.070
And then,

33:25.240 --> 33:26.500
she got tired of biting

33:27.160 --> 33:28.720
but still didn't let go.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.360
She pressed down on my leg

33:32.070 --> 33:33.600
and even talked in her sleep

33:34.160 --> 33:35.090
the whole night.

33:35.720 --> 33:37.580
So you must have hated her, right?

33:55.440 --> 33:57.210
Well, I mean...

33:59.400 --> 34:00.600
Logically speaking,

34:02.400 --> 34:03.930
I should have disliked her.

34:06.030 --> 34:07.690
But somehow I just watched her

34:09.409 --> 34:10.760
all night in that state,

34:12.150 --> 34:15.460
finding her delicately pretty

34:15.980 --> 34:17.120
and adorable.

34:19.030 --> 34:21.429
My legs didn't even
feel that numb anymore.

34:32.360 --> 34:33.030
So,

34:33.719 --> 34:35.850
you started to be into her at that time?

34:36.400 --> 34:37.070
Right?

34:46.590 --> 34:47.230
Yes.

34:50.000 --> 34:51.330
That was when

34:52.400 --> 34:53.710
I started to fall for Zui.

34:52.420 --> 34:54.159
♪ The tall trees are intertwined ♪

34:54.719 --> 34:56.020
♪ You are so close to me ♪

34:54.880 --> 34:57.980
I remember I was only
nine years old that year.

34:56.380 --> 34:59.320
♪ In the wind and moonlight, my amorous feelings linger ♪

34:58.760 --> 35:00.030
I went to get a bamboo

35:00.000 --> 35:01.890
♪ You gallop on horseback ♪

35:00.440 --> 35:01.840
in a bamboo grove,

35:02.060 --> 35:03.420
carving some words on it.

35:02.210 --> 35:03.820
♪ As if you came as soon as you heard the news ♪

35:03.840 --> 35:05.280
What words?

35:04.220 --> 35:07.040
♪ You want to rekindle the stars in my eyes ♪

35:07.610 --> 35:09.370
♪ Through the troubled times filled with beacon fires and chaos ♪

35:07.690 --> 35:09.440
What are they?

35:09.650 --> 35:11.030
♪ We watch the spring blossoms and autumn fruits ♪

35:10.640 --> 35:14.530
Then why don't you
confess your love to Zui directly?

35:11.880 --> 35:14.760
♪ Only you make me feel at ease ♪

35:15.310 --> 35:17.180
♪ I want to ♪

35:17.710 --> 35:19.320
♪ Look into your eyes day after day ♪

35:18.430 --> 35:20.560
If I can't guarantee her a good life,

35:19.870 --> 35:22.900
♪ But my heartfelt words are hidden behind my lips ♪

35:23.490 --> 35:26.380
♪ Watching you under the setting sun's afterglow ♪

35:23.940 --> 35:25.670
I have no right to speak of love.

35:26.900 --> 35:29.990
♪ Is so meaningful and lasting, just like a dream ♪

35:28.710 --> 35:29.670
So,

35:30.550 --> 35:32.800
this is why you always push me away.

35:31.590 --> 35:33.950
♪ In that distant light, it's all about ♪

35:34.150 --> 35:35.400
Our Zui

35:35.030 --> 35:37.280
♪ The rest of my life that I'm longing for ♪

35:36.520 --> 35:38.080
deserves all the love.

35:39.490 --> 35:40.730
♪ Time slips away ♪

35:40.150 --> 35:41.630
My current wish

35:41.690 --> 35:44.460
♪ In this life, I'm arrogant and overbearing just for you ♪

35:42.280 --> 35:43.590
is to protect her

35:44.400 --> 35:45.320
by her side

35:45.510 --> 35:48.880
♪ I wish that from now on, when the flowers bloom ♪

35:46.400 --> 35:47.320
until

35:48.000 --> 35:49.510
she meets her Mr. Right.

35:49.510 --> 35:50.400
Yes!

35:50.080 --> 35:53.070
♪ We are all the same ♪

35:50.800 --> 35:51.360
Right!

35:52.280 --> 35:54.030
You're thinking too much.

35:55.140 --> 35:58.230
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

35:58.850 --> 36:01.990
♪ It makes me restrained yet infatuated ♪

35:59.920 --> 36:00.850
Let's continue.

36:01.000 --> 36:01.800
Ignore him.

36:02.030 --> 36:03.840
Think about what Zui wants.

36:03.050 --> 36:06.070
♪ Do you know the feeling of gathering the morning flowers in the evening? ♪

36:06.600 --> 36:09.800
♪ It's the most regrettable thing ♪

36:06.880 --> 36:07.670
Yitan,

36:08.550 --> 36:10.280
you see the big picture and think a lot,

36:10.280 --> 36:11.560
hoping to do things perfectly.

36:10.710 --> 36:13.880
♪ Do you know that staying together for a lifetime ♪

36:11.710 --> 36:12.440
That's good.

36:13.600 --> 36:15.620
But when it comes
to a relationship, hesitation

36:14.590 --> 36:17.560
♪ Is the most beautiful vow I've ever made? ♪

36:16.320 --> 36:17.600
means cowardice.

36:18.280 --> 36:20.250
♪ Do you know your name ♪

36:20.980 --> 36:22.230
♪ Is the shortest love poem ♪

36:22.840 --> 36:27.930
♪ I've ever read? ♪

36:35.440 --> 36:36.030
Yitan.

36:37.000 --> 36:37.690
Hongye.

36:38.230 --> 36:39.290
What's the matter?

36:41.280 --> 36:44.080
There's something
I'd like to negotiate with you.

36:45.190 --> 36:46.250
Then come in first.

36:47.190 --> 36:47.840
Hongye.

36:49.360 --> 36:50.620
I'd rather say it here.

36:57.310 --> 36:58.650
I want to propose to Zui.

37:01.670 --> 37:03.070
I hope you can agree to it.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.620
I've thought it through.

37:05.620 --> 37:06.650
Life is short,

37:07.040 --> 37:09.170
and we don't know
what will happen in the future.

37:09.170 --> 37:10.940
Zui has always been so nice to me,

37:10.940 --> 37:12.540
and I genuinely like her too.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.780
And I don't want to hurt

37:17.190 --> 37:18.450
her feelings anymore.

37:22.110 --> 37:23.230
Does Zui know about it?

37:23.230 --> 37:24.230
Not yet.

37:27.800 --> 37:30.330
You two have been betrothed
since childhood.

37:30.840 --> 37:31.640
I'm certainly

37:32.750 --> 37:33.880
rooting for you two.

37:35.110 --> 37:36.170
Thank you, Hongye.

37:36.360 --> 37:38.090
Then I'll go prepare for it now.

37:39.000 --> 37:40.060
Young Master Yang.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.160
Young Master,

37:44.590 --> 37:46.520
the young lady wants to talk to you.

37:48.630 --> 37:50.590
What's up? You need my help?

37:51.190 --> 37:51.800
Yes.

37:52.510 --> 37:53.360
I

37:53.360 --> 37:54.760
want to propose to Yitan.

37:55.550 --> 37:56.670
Whether you agree or not,

37:56.670 --> 37:57.670
I'm going to do it.

37:58.590 --> 37:59.820
Life is short.

37:59.960 --> 38:01.680
Only recently did I realize

38:01.800 --> 38:03.800
Yitan's care for me after so many years.

38:03.800 --> 38:06.530
I don't want to hurt his feelings anymore.

38:09.290 --> 38:10.760
So you've already made up your mind.

38:10.760 --> 38:12.360
Well, I still have to tell you.

38:12.360 --> 38:13.550
The eldest brother is like a father!

38:13.550 --> 38:15.150
So you just informed me of it?

38:15.580 --> 38:16.680
I've made a plan.

38:16.920 --> 38:19.360
I'll confess my love
near the Ruyi Pavilion.
